{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "049eis_402_2_4_049_02_09_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:5a171871eb1b29cbb5e61540cf89091b73d44dff46cbf9241d300d8c82cd99d3",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:049eis_402_2_4_049_02_09_c:2_4_049_02_09_c:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67b42cc8802fc741797262d678356dbb079b35259ae548298beda9b790e3664c",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，是我。你接下来的时间\n有空吗？我想向你汇报一下目前的进度。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_402_2_4_049_02_09_c:2_4_049_02_09_c:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d106de713cc4f30d1c8f45ddec867b43c5e04728a63934639e171f525d745671",
      "text": "有的，有空！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_402_2_4_049_02_09_c:2_4_049_02_09_c:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:458cc4543af35400d2dcd0c4522b3778aea8cd02ff5f79c42932ac6025da9f42",
      "text": "这样么。那么，请到平时的练习室来一趟。\n虽然在电话里也能简单说明，但具体进展还是当面展示为好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_402_2_4_049_02_09_c:2_4_049_02_09_c:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa156bab216cdd368bcda3727e4965e68217559bb2e075ba62973a11f08ea64d",
      "text": "首先，多亏了秀搜集到的精准情报，\n练习得以高效推进。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_402_2_4_049_02_09_c:2_4_049_02_09_c:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fd20668839a65092597bd5ff096b299638e208bb8d4243e37632be42fd5521c",
      "text": "也有关于世界观的资料在，\n大家也都理解了各自被要求的角色定位。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_402_2_4_049_02_09_c:2_4_049_02_09_c:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88e727d6c647944c8dbaea31e02965c4b080533b9ac04bd4137d7ab46ad00e64",
      "text": "综合以上这些，我想请你过目一次\n我们如今的成果。可以拜托你吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_402_2_4_049_02_09_c:2_4_049_02_09_c:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6536599ceb763c26c3c0c8d1475141bd6e072aec2e452837edf417e39d8e7e0",
      "text": "包在我身上",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_402_2_4_049_02_09_c:2_4_049_02_09_c:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5ce1b5fd7cddc7c343767afd2a1f9ffbea95a4404441977346956d0dba9c5b1",
      "text": "我这就过去！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_402_2_4_049_02_09_c:2_4_049_02_09_c:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b800036f7b2770fb24fa7cacfa19bfa31972197047487023bd0e3b30a8b2c132",
      "text": "明白了。到了附近就联系我。\n我回练习室了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
